      "id": "claim_d7ac85a2ce1b4600940a3495c0edc7fd",
      "statement": "The persistence package is Postgres-only: it exports postgresEnvironmentSchema, postgresConnection, postgresDataSourceOptions, PostgresqlModule.forRoot (also as DatabaseModule), createDataSource, the four Postgresql base entities (Identifiable, Creatable, Updatable, Deletable), PostgresqlService (also as DatabaseService), and from the testing subpath startPostgresContainer and startDatabaseTestingModule. It also exports PostgresqlErdModule/PostgresqlErdService for ER diagrams, Graph/DirectedAcyclicGraph/RenderMermaidModule for Mermaid flowcharts, and graph edge utilities. No SQLite exports remain.",
